{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_01",
  "title": "节前热身",
  "storyCode": "AS-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a6398dea15e3f0afe08f1856845b7841de51f0b4ca87cd8a8b0c8775518202e3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g6_museum_core"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尸体......尸体动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，快离开这里！这里闹鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那具古尸是不是朝我看过来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道一个城市历史太悠久迟早有天会发生这种事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诸位请冷静下来，不要着急，不要慌张！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请大家从安全出口有序离开，往这边！不要挤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，让一下，让我们过去一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*萨尔贡粗口*，阿娜特！阿娜特！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "挤过拥挤的人群，梅捷缇克缇看到阿娜特面色苍白瘫倒在地，嘴唇无力地张合，似乎有话要说。\n但后方歪着头的尸体让她心生恐惧，不敢凑上前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "缇缇，辛苦你确保参观者们的安全，我想办法将阿娜特和这具古尸带到别的地方去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是一点也不害怕吗？那玩意在动啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也......还好吧，咳咳，我今年参与了两座古历纪时期坟墓的考古工作，两位墓主人我都亲眼见过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起它们，这位老先生已经算是慈眉善目的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这干过考古的胆色就是不一般......你一个人行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我们干过考古的体力也很不一般。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "缇缇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿娜特她......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她应该没大碍，只是昏迷中的呓语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馆长办公室离这里不远，你们从侧门出去，尽量避开人群，等我将游客疏散完毕再过去找你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g5_museum"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生什么了？我还没到埋伏的地点呢！你们提前启动发烟器了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左边的耳机",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没啊，我们还没有行动呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "右边的耳机",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是会场中有其他人引起了骚动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是......我没在人群中看到目标，她去哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，状况有变，我们的计划提前进行。找到她，盯紧了，时刻向我汇报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "右边的耳机",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽快，等得手后我们需要汇入人群才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到人都疏散干净，一切都晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g6_museum_core"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好......这里人都走光了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "靠上前去，佩佩看见古尸胸腔内正流动着萤蓝色的光芒。\n而那颗宝石早已消失在光芒中，再也看不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，果然因为宝石的原因......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这个姿势......也不是很好扛啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "围着尸体观察几秒后，佩佩决定将古尸抬起的左臂按下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（按下左臂）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（抬起右臂）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（按下右臂）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（抬起左臂）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佩佩皱起眉头，歪着脑袋思考该如何让这具古尸乖乖听话。\n但她惊讶地发现，它竟然也歪过脑袋，做出思考的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢着，你这......是在学我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佩佩向左迈出一步，下一刻，古尸也照着她的样子迈出一步，步伐相差无几。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，佩佩向后一跳，古尸也跟着往后一跳，但后面就是墙壁，撞出好大一声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗嗤——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你是光会动胳膊腿脚，脑筋是一点也不会动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，如果我们动作一致，那岂不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看向一旁昏睡的阿娜特，佩佩心中有个念头冒了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g5_museum"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好......马上就要到馆长办公室了，你跟我学着点，转弯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（向右转）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得让它把阿娜特的肩膀抓紧点，刚刚差点就掉下去了，这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（动动右手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（捏紧阿娜特的肩膀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（无意识地拧眉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞，接着跟我走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（无意识的呻吟）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不，不行，它步子迈得太大可能会让阿娜特不舒服......咱们这次迈小步子啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当你答应了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这不就对了......\n哎，别别别——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "因为步子太碎，佩佩看着古尸踩到自己长长的衣摆，向前倒去，狠狠砸在娇小的阿娜特身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（无意识的闷哼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这脸上的红印要什么时候才消得下去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......你可真是个大聪明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷静，这次可要抱稳她，抱紧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（无意识地拧眉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，跟我一起走，步子不要太大也不要太小，很好......往前走......再走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，不要着急，我们慢慢来，离办公室就差几步了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "侧过头，佩佩看到冰冷的地板上躺着一枚通行证，正是从自己的衣兜掉出的。\n她看了看举起的双手，又看了看尸体抱住阿娜特的双手。\n那具古尸很高，如果对方松手，阿娜特的后脑勺一定会摔得很惨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可怎么进办公室......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一只手都松不了啊......只能用脚去够了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（伸出一只脚）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（伸出一只脚）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，保持平衡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，还是够不到，柔韧性太差了，早知道就不逃健体课了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加把劲，你可以够到的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恶啊......唉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尽管已经拼尽全力，但佩佩的脚尖依然够不到近在咫尺的通行证。\n而摆出扭曲姿势的她也再难保持平衡，脚下一歪，便栽倒在地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尸体也学着她的模样，松开了阿娜特，以相同的姿势倒在地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就这么眼睁睁地，佩佩看见阿娜特的脑袋砸向地板，发出闷声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（无意识的哀鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......对不起，阿娜特，你下个研究项目我一定鼎力支持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，请问您需要帮忙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，谢谢，你能来真是太好了，你们的馆长身体不适，可以帮我把她扶进办公室吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，我将馆长放在沙发上了。您的姿势看起来非常别扭，真的不打算站起来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，这是我舒展筋骨的特别方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，那展品呢，我也需要帮您搬进去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，我自己一个人搞得定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......您有需要随时再叫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......终于能动了......差点被发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看我干什么，一起进来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g6_museum_core"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁图亚，好消息......目标位置确定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我刚刚在四号展厅附近遇到了她，帮她将昏迷的馆长搬进了办公室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我确定，她就在办公室中。里面除了昏迷的馆长外只有她一个人，我拿到了她的通行证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，没问题，我就在这里等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉雅阿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，梅捷缇克缇女士，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博物馆里都乱成这样了，你怎么还在这里闲逛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们马上就要闭馆了，快将这些迷路的游客带出博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底发生什么了？我们现在要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会有危险吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诸位请放心，只要跟好我们的员工，她会将你们带到安全的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可、可是......我还有其他的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我们有危险？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是谁把云兽放进博物馆的？馆内禁止携带宠物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我没看到云兽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的工作疏忽我们等会儿再讨论，我先去抓它。人这么多，它会被踩到的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看来只能由我来带游客离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）算了，应该来得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诸位，请跟我来吧，这边右转就是安全出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，可这不是左边吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她都是这里的员工了，应该也不会有错吧......哎，小姑娘你别走那么快啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g7_galleriesstaircase"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一扇沉重的展厅大门被推开又合上。\n没有人想起它应该开着，没有人担心它被随意推开，也没有人来维护门上写着“东北部分支展厅”的铭牌。\n展厅肃穆寂静。\n阿斯帕齐娅的心脏剧烈地跳动起来，几乎盖过她小心翼翼的脚步声。\n经过覆灭部族灰黑的界碑石，五色线的谢拉格织毯，她的视线投向展厅昏暗的深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......终于。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的历史就在此处静静等待着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我应当承认，瞻仰历史，正是要有这样庄重宁静的气氛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。在我面前展开的画卷，是哪一座覆灭神殿的浮雕墙？如此洁白无瑕的石材，取自米诺斯的哪一座山峰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有用文物堆砌出的家庭一角，对古代米诺斯生活场景的复现，多么精彩的想象力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一切都弄错了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我认得你，曾摆放在神殿正中的金杯。许多年前，我的外祖父来这里看过你，我的母亲亦然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家族曾因为遗失了你而受苦无数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这座博物馆为什么把它放在装发酵乳的陶碗中间？无论依据材质还是装饰风格，都应该能判断它们不是成套的物品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与它成对的另一只金杯又去了哪里？当年萨尔贡人将它们全部掳走，为什么不知道妥善保管？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至展品介绍也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她久久地凝视展签，继而将金属片从墙上拔下，检阅背面。\n无论哪一面都无比光滑平整，只映出她自己的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，这个只是没写。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——但这些文物出现在这里，才是最大的错误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "百余年前，米诺斯人受尽屈辱，看着萨尔贡的军队踏入米诺斯的领土，肆意践踏我们的文明与历史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本不该如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必须拿走它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诸位，顺着阶梯往下，你们就可以顺利离开博物馆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，我还有事，先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是感觉哪里怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来时我们好像走的不是这条路啊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是这里的员工......应该不会错的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们真的能从这里出去，然后回家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我应当带你们回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我应当把你们交给米诺斯的祭司，由他们进行研究，由他们保存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅庄重地走向展台，捧起金杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米诺斯的诸多文物就不该躺在这间不见天日的展馆中，不受重视，无人问津。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别挤，别挤啊！我都看不到前面的路了，安全出口怎么连指示地灯都没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，那边有个工作人员在摆放展品，她看起来比刚才的人可靠！赶紧问问！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们是来参观——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——请问这里是离开展馆的路吗，女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有什么可以帮到你们的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
